### ============================================
### 5. EDGE CASE TESTS
### ============================================

### Get non-existent note
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/000000000000000000000000

### Delete already deleted note
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notes/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Search with empty query
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes?search=&page=1

### Pagination with invalid page (out of bounds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes?page=99999&limit=10

### Pagination with page=0 (should fail 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes?page=0&limit=10

### Get notes with multiple filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes?search=array&subject={{subjectId}}&topic=Arrays&page=1